{
  "$comment": "ATA-3 at ISSUANCE — authority.linkAttenuates. The `authority.attenuation` area covers isWithin (bounds only, silent on delegable/maxDepth); this area covers the DELEGATION gates that decide whether a link was permitted to exist at all. Composite predicate: the parent permitted delegation, depth remains below it, the link stated a depth that fits, and the bounds are contained. An absent `delegable` is non-delegable (restrictive default); an absent `maxDepth` is UNBOUNDED, which is why omitting it below a depth-bounded parent is an escalation rather than an inherited default. Producer and verifier must not diverge — the verify-side mirror of these cases is verify/authority-walk.json.",
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "a narrower link from a delegable parent with depth to spare attenuates",
      "input": {
        "link": {
          "@context": ["https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2"],
          "type": ["VerifiableCredential"],
          "issuer": "did:web:integraledger.com",
          "credentialSubject": {
            "id": "did:example:child",
            "bounds": {
              "caps": {
                "USD": "5000"
              }
            },
            "delegable": false,
            "maxDepth": 0
          }
        },
        "parent": {
          "@context": ["https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2"],
          "type": ["VerifiableCredential"],
          "issuer": "did:web:integraledger.com",
          "credentialSubject": {
            "id": "did:example:root",
            "bounds": {
              "caps": {
                "USD": "1000000"
              }
            },
            "delegable": true,
            "maxDepth": 2
          }
        }
      },
      "expected": true
    },
    {
      "name": "a parent that never permitted delegation refuses the link however well its bounds attenuate",
      "input": {
        "link": {
          "@context": ["https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2"],
          "type": ["VerifiableCredential"],
          "issuer": "did:web:integraledger.com",
          "credentialSubject": {
            "id": "did:example:child",
            "bounds": {
              "caps": {
                "USD": "1"
              }
            },
            "delegable": false,
            "maxDepth": 0
          }
        },
        "parent": {
          "@context": ["https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2"],
          "type": ["VerifiableCredential"],
          "issuer": "did:web:integraledger.com",
          "credentialSubject": {
            "id": "did:example:root",
            "bounds": {
              "caps": {
                "USD": "1000000"
              }
            },
            "delegable": false,
            "maxDepth": 9
          }
        }
      },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "an ABSENT delegable on the parent is non-delegable — the restrictive default, not an unstated yes",
      "input": {
        "link": {
          "@context": ["https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2"],
          "type": ["VerifiableCredential"],
          "issuer": "did:web:integraledger.com",
          "credentialSubject": {
            "id": "did:example:child",
            "bounds": {
              "caps": {
                "USD": "1"
              }
            },
            "delegable": false,
            "maxDepth": 0
          }
        },
        "parent": {
          "@context": ["https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2"],
          "type": ["VerifiableCredential"],
          "issuer": "did:web:integraledger.com",
          "credentialSubject": {
            "id": "did:example:root",
            "bounds": {
              "caps": {
                "USD": "1000000"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a depth-exhausted parent (maxDepth 0 = leaf) admits nothing below it",
      "input": {
        "link": {
          "@context": ["https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2"],
          "type": ["VerifiableCredential"],
          "issuer": "did:web:integraledger.com",
          "credentialSubject": {
            "id": "did:example:child",
            "bounds": {
              "caps": {
                "USD": "1"
              }
            },
            "delegable": false,
            "maxDepth": 0
          }
        },
        "parent": {
          "@context": ["https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2"],
          "type": ["VerifiableCredential"],
          "issuer": "did:web:integraledger.com",
          "credentialSubject": {
            "id": "did:example:root",
            "bounds": {
              "caps": {
                "USD": "1000000"
              }
            },
            "delegable": true,
            "maxDepth": 0
          }
        }
      },
      "expected": false
    },
    {
      "name": "a link that mints itself MORE onward depth than the parent held is refused",
      "input": {
        "link": {
          "@context": ["https://www.w3.org/ns/credentials/v2"],
          "type": ["VerifiableCredential"],
          "issuer": "did:web:integraledger.com",
          "credentialSubject": {
            "id": "did:example:child",
            "bounds": {
              "caps": {
                "USD": "1"
